    <content><![CDATA[<p><img src="/hexoblog/images/welcome.svg" alt="Your blog is ready"></p>
<h2 id="你好，欢迎来到你的博客"><a href="#你好，欢迎来到你的博客" class="headerlink" title="你好，欢迎来到你的博客"></a>你好，欢迎来到你的博客</h2><p>这篇文章说明博客已经成功创建。你可以回到 HexoLaunch 后台修改或删除它，然后发布自己的第一篇文章。</p>
<p>文章、图片和博客设置都保存在你自己的 GitHub 仓库中。你不需要学习 Git、Hexo、YAML 或命令行。</p>
<h2 id="Hello-and-welcome"><a href="#Hello-and-welcome" class="headerlink" title="Hello, and welcome"></a>Hello, and welcome</h2><p>This post confirms that your blog was created successfully. Open HexoLaunch to edit or remove it, then publish your first story.</p>
<p>Your posts, images, and blog settings are stored in your own GitHub repository. You do not need to learn Git, Hexo, YAML, or command-line tools.</p>
]]></content>
